Serializable operation mode/scopes/idempotency/fields/pagination/capability/deprecation;
transport-neutral `OperationInvoker`; `ApiProfile` projection and typed API options;
live effective capability discovery; package-owned optional routes; async 202 + Location;
tenant DB idempotency table/store/invoker decorator; signed scoped cursor with separate
format/order versions; `ResourceId`; client/actor/record/field/tenant authorization matrix;
real `onlyFields` enforcement; additive envelope and RFC 9457 negotiation; snapshots
`openapi/operations/errors/manifest`; stdlib compatibility gate and planted negatives;
policy/reference/readme/changelog/receipt; P14 consumer proof.

GraphQL schema/adapter/dependency/capability/snapshot; implicit CRUD; domain repositories;
generic record ownership lookup; cost/rate budgets; bulk lifecycle/store/result/cancel;
webhook subscription/delivery/signature/secret rotation; provider/client generation;
SaaS cadence/limits; snapshot isolation promise; search cursor format migration;
package/class renames (P15); release/tag/split mirror (P17).

Execution requires terminal P4, P7, P11 and P12 plus D14 stage-2 audit. Within P13:
`P13.1 → {B21, P13.7, P13.8}`; B21 = `P13.2 + P13.3`;
`P13.3 → P13.4`; `P13.5 → P13.6` and P13.6 also waits P13.2;
P13.8 waits P13.2; B22 = `P13.9 + P13.10` sequential after P13.2/P13.3;
`P13.10 → P13.11`; all → P13.12. Batches are recommendations; items close separately.
